# Design system — Gallius Dynamic Media Engine

## Source of truth

Compose tokens live under `app/src/main/java/com/balius/galius/ui/theme/`:

- `Color.kt` — Material + brand + tag taxonomy
- `Type.kt` — Inter-targeted typography (`GaliusExtendedTypography` + M3 map)
- `Shape.kt` — radii (cards 16dp, sheets 24dp, pills full)
- `Spacing.kt` — 8pt rhythm
- `Theme.kt` — `GaliusTheme`, `GaliusThemeTokens`, extended colors

Human summary: `docs/DESIGN.md`. Stitch reference: Downloads `stitch_gallius_media_catalog_ui`.

## Rules

- Wrap UI in `GaliusTheme`. Default brand is dark; Light / System modes are user-selectable in Settings.
- Prefer theme tokens over hardcoded `Color.White` / `CanvasBase` so Light mode stays readable.
- Prefer `MaterialTheme.colorScheme` / `typography` / `shapes` for Material roles.
- Prefer `GaliusThemeTokens.colors` for canvas, card, glass, accents, tag chips, scrims.
- Prefer `GaliusSpacing` and `GaliusRadius` / `MediaCardShape` / `PillShape` — no magic dens.
- No hardcoded `#RRGGBB` in feature composables; add a token if missing.
- Bottom nav labels: Home, Search, Settings (`nav_home`, `nav_search`, `nav_settings`).
- Aspect ratios: posters `2:3`, video/backdrops `16:9`, square `1:1`.
